<p>Enjoying a perfect day with barely a breeze, thousands of area residents attended the 1911 Missouri Slope Fair and witnessed an airplane demonstration by barnstormer {% person "lucky-bob-st-henry" %}Robert "Lucky Bob" St. Henry{% endperson %}. Of the thousands in attendance, no more than 20 had ever seen an airplane.</p>

